```plaintext
---
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
---
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous_driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :Scene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :FoggyCondition ;
    :hasRoadInfrastructure :UrbanRoadInfrastructure .

:FoggyCondition a :WeatherCondition ;
    :visibilityRange "low" ;
    :fogDensity "high" .

:UrbanRoadInfrastructure a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :hasTrafficLight :TrafficLight1 ;
    :hasCrosswalk :Crosswalk1 ;
    :hasRoadMarkings :RoadMarkings1 .

:TrafficLight1 a :TrafficLight ;
    :position "intersection" ;
    :status "unknown" .

:Crosswalk1 a :Crosswalk ;
    :position "intersection" .

:RoadMarkings1 a :RoadMarkings ;
    :type "solid_and_dashed_lines" .

:Vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "sedan" ;
    :vehicleColor "red" ;
    :position "front_right" ;
    :hasDriver "autonomous" .

:Vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "sedan" ;
    :vehicleColor "grey" ;
    :position "distance" ;
    :direction "approaching" .

:Scene1 :contains :Vehicle1 ;
    :contains :Vehicle2 .

:Vehicle1 :isNear :Crosswalk1 ;
    :isFollowing :none ;
    :isOccludedBy :FoggyCondition .

:Vehicle2 :isApproaching :Crosswalk1 ;
    :isOccludedBy :FoggyCondition .

---
Identified Risks for each risk class
---
Risk 1:
Description: High fog density reduces visibility, increasing the risk of collision due to the inability to detect other vehicles or pedestrians in time.
Severity Score: 0.9

Risk 2:
Description: Unknown status of traffic lights may lead to incorrect assumptions about right-of-way, causing potential conflicts with other vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.8

Risk 3:
Description: The autonomous vehicle's sensors may fail to accurately detect and classify the grey vehicle due to fog, leading to delayed or incorrect decision-making.
Severity Score: 0.85

Risk 4:
Description: The presence of a crosswalk increases the risk of pedestrians crossing unexpectedly, which may not be visible due to fog.
Severity Score: 0.8

Risk 5:
Description: Road markings may be obscured by fog, leading to confusion about lane boundaries and increasing the risk of lane deviations or collisions.
Severity Score: 0.75
---
```